# Build the private media worker launched by yt-dlp_serv.py.
# The Rust stage builds the optional automap_rs wheel; the runtime needs FFmpeg,
# Deno, Python media dependencies, media/ and bundled fonts. Compose persists media
# under /tmp/automap_storage. Keep COPY paths synchronized with package moves;
# this image intentionally does not need the web templates or map artwork.
# Copyright 2025-2026 deltaaa00
